   "answer": "- **Yield (R1-2):** Table 6G-1’s “Yield” row and “Minimum” column list **30 × 30 × 30**, but the table does not state the unit. [1]\n- **45 mph:** Table 3B-1’s “45 mph” row and “Minimum Passing Sight Distance” column list **700 feet**. [2]\n\n**The documents give different values:**\n- Federal, MUTCD 11th Edition (December 2023), Part 6: Temporary Traffic Control: 30 x 30 x 30 [1]\n- Federal, MUTCD 11th Edition (December 2023), Part 3: Markings: 700 feet [2]\n\n**Recommendation** (the assistant's judgment, not an NCDOT rule): Check both documents; neither value is shown as the one to follow.",
